  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expansion of the National Center for Cardiology Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective: to contribute to the achievement of the health-related SDG3 (Target 3.4) to reduce by one third premature mortality from non-communicable diseases including cardiovascular diseases.



The specific objective: The project will contribute to reducing mortality and morbidity from major cardiovascular diseases and outpatient evacuation of children for cardiovascular healthcare services by 50% through increasing the capacity of the National center of Cardiology to better meet the population&apos;s demand for:

- Specialized pediatric cardiac surgery care 

- Neurovascular and respiratory diseases care

- Cardiovascular intensive care 

- Units for prevention, cardiac rehabilitation and therapeutic education for cardiovascular pathologies.</narrative>
  </description>
